#: tavletta/ui/texts.py:99
msgid ""
"Labels of a series sent to the printer as one job, which it prints without "
"stopping between them. Stop and cancel take effect between jobs: a job that "
"has started is printed in full. Lower it if the printer runs out of memory."
msgstr "Label daripada satu siri yang dihantar ke pencetak sebagai satu tugas dan dicetak tanpa berhenti di antaranya. Henti dan batal berkuat kuasa di antara tugas: tugas yang sudah bermula dicetak sepenuhnya. Kurangkan nilai jika memori pencetak habis."

